        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">hibridni razsmernik; 2 MPPT, nizov na MPPT [1, 1], U_dc max 1100 V, MPPT [160, 1000] V, I max [16, 16] A; baterija [600, 900] V; komunikacija: RS485-1 (prosta), RS485-2 (Sigen Sensor TP-DH / TP-CT…-DH), RJ45 BAT (SigenStor BC), 2x FE (RJ45), WLAN (ANT), 4G Sigen CommMod, 5x DI (rezervirano DRM/RCR), 2x DO preklopni (rezervirano), 5 V (rezervirano)</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Datasheet - Sigen Hybrid Inverter SP2 &amp; TP2 (Version 20260601), Sigenergy str. 2 (levo SP2, desno TP2); Sigen Hybrid (3.0-12.0) TP2 Series Installation Guide, v04 (2026-04-21); iz ZIP Sigen Hybrid (3.0-12.0) TP2 Series Installer Manual_EN.zip str. 2 (Port Introduction, mere), 4 (kabli), 11 (COM), 14 (PV nizi); Sigen Hybrid SP2, TP2 Series and SigenStor Energy User Manual str. 17-18 (AC stikalo), 24-25; teh_iz_ponudb (Generator ponudb SOLION) - obstoječi tehnični zapis s preseki kablov in AC stikali str. polje teh_iz_ponudb pri artiklu</elementInformation>
